{"4744360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Benny's Big Rescue", "steam_appid": 4744360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BENNY NEEDS YOUR HELP!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A BIG RESCUE, FOR A LITTLE HERO</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benny’s best friend, Mr. Cuddles, has been snatched away by the troublesome Rex! Now it is up to Benny to set off on a big adventure, follow the clues, fight off enemies, and bring his best buddy home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPLORE THE WORLD OF FANTASEA</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday spaces become larger-than-life adventures in Benny’s imagination. Journey through towering pillow forts, bustling toy cities, shaggy carpet frontiers, and other playful places filled with secrets to discover.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DRESS FOR THE ADVENTURE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes being Benny isn’t enough! Discover different costumes that give Benny new abilities and new ways to explore the world. Use them to overcome obstacles, reach new places, and solve puzzles along the way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>JUMP, PUZZLE &amp; PLAY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across obstacles, solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and face a few pesky enemies along the way. Each new challenge brings Benny one step closer to finding Rex and rescuing Mr. Cuddles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BENNY NEEDS YOUR HELP!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A BIG RESCUE, FOR A LITTLE HERO</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benny’s best friend, Mr. Cuddles, has been snatched away by the troublesome Rex! Now it is up to Benny to set off on a big adventure, follow the clues, fight off enemies, and bring his best buddy home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/bf1a3d0debb648f675a1d7ba5ee26c75.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPLORE THE WORLD OF FANTASEA</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday spaces become larger-than-life adventures in Benny’s imagination. Journey through towering pillow forts, bustling toy cities, shaggy carpet frontiers, and other playful places filled with secrets to discover.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/a5d94a5a18b4b75520e876beeae272f8.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DRESS FOR THE ADVENTURE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes being Benny isn’t enough! Discover different costumes that give Benny new abilities and new ways to explore the world. Use them to overcome obstacles, reach new places, and solve puzzles along the way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/2aba539d9b2fac071b27aa4f3ac83c19.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>JUMP, PUZZLE &amp; PLAY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across obstacles, solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and face a few pesky enemies along the way. Each new challenge brings Benny one step closer to finding Rex and rescuing Mr. Cuddles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.poster.avif?t=1788242716\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.webm?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/extras/cb447624c6ddfec9eff8429156b46d35.mp4?t=1788242716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Benny’s Big Rescue is a whimsical action-adventure focused on story quests, exploration, costume abilities, platforming, puzzles, and light combat. Rescue Mr. Cuddles from Rex across Fantasea’s pillow forts, toy cities, and carpet wilds.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/3c962134495ac2201209d0b21ebf4a599b3a86db/header.jpg?t=1788242716", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/a23c4910bedba5934d05e0d015da89f2f0c67ead/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788242716", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/a23c4910bedba5934d05e0d015da89f2f0c67ead/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788242716", "website": "https://bennysbigrescue.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or NVIDIA GT 730 (DirectX 11)<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Indie Games Startup LLC"], "publishers": ["Indie Games Startup LLC"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744360/6a840ab743f4198fd5d85a228cee63674402c7e2/ss_6a840ab743f4198fd5d85a228cee63674402c7e2.600x338.jpg?t=1788242716